{
    "comment": "방금 요청한 내보내기의 진행 표시 — 상품·주문·마일리지 목록이 함께 쓴다(#787). 요청 창이 접수 응답으로\n  `_global.ecommerceExportTracking` 을 채우고 5초마다 작업 상세를 받아 갱신한다(대기·진행중이 끝나면 멈춘다). 목록에 들어올 때\n  `<init>` 이 비우므로 이 화면에서 요청한 1건만 보인다. [받기]는 내보내기 관리의 파일명 단추와 같은 일회용 주소 경로이고\n  권한·범위 검사도 같다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "Ecommerce Export - Tracking Status"
    },
    "id": "ecommerce_export_tracking",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTracking?.id}}",
    "props": {
        "role": "status",
        "className": "flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 whitespace-nowrap"
    },
    "children": [
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Span",
            "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTracking?.status === 'pending' || _global.ecommerceExportTracking?.status === 'processing'}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "flex items-center gap-1"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Icon",
                    "props": {
                        "name": "spinner",
                        "className": "spinner-sm"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Span",
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.tracking.processing"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Span",
            "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTracking?.status === 'completed'}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "text-green-700 dark:text-green-400"
            },
            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.tracking.ready"
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Button",
            "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTracking?.status === 'completed' && _global.ecommerceExportTracking?.can_download === true}}",
            "actions": [
                {
                    "comment": "그 자리에서 받기 — 서버가 다운로드 이력·횟수를 남긴다. 성공·실패 모두 진행 표시를 푼다",
                    "type": "click",
                    "handler": "sequence",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "handler": "setState",
                            "params": {
                                "target": "global",
                                "ecommerceExportTrackingDownloading": true
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "handler": "sirsoft-ecommerce.downloadExportFile",
                            "params": {
                                "url": "/api/modules/sirsoft-ecommerce/admin/exports/{{_global.ecommerceExportTracking?.id}}/download-link",
                                "filename": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTracking?.file_name}}"
                            },
                            "onSuccess": {
                                "handler": "setState",
                                "params": {
                                    "target": "global",
                                    "ecommerceExportTrackingDownloading": false
                                }
                            },
                            "onError": [
                                {
                                    "handler": "setState",
                                    "params": {
                                        "target": "global",
                                        "ecommerceExportTrackingDownloading": false
                                    }
                                },
                                {
                                    "handler": "toast",
                                    "params": {
                                        "type": "error",
                                        "message": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.messages.download_failed"
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ],
            "props": {
                "type": "button",
                "className": "flex items-center gap-1 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                "disabled": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTrackingDownloading === true}}"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Icon",
                    "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTrackingDownloading === true}}",
                    "props": {
                        "name": "spinner",
                        "className": "spinner-sm"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Span",
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.tracking.download"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Span",
            "if": "{{_global.ecommerceExportTracking?.status === 'failed' || _global.ecommerceExportTracking?.status === 'expired'}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
            },
            "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.tracking.failed"
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "A",
            "if": "{{['completed', 'failed', 'expired'].includes(_global.ecommerceExportTracking?.status) && !(_global.ecommerceExportTracking?.status === 'completed' && _global.ecommerceExportTracking?.can_download === true)}}",
            "props": {
                "href": "/admin/ecommerce/exports",
                "className": "text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Span",
                    "text": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.tracking.open_manage"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Button",
            "actions": [
                {
                    "comment": "표시 닫기 — 따라가던 반복도 멈춘다",
                    "type": "click",
                    "handler": "sequence",
                    "actions": [
                        {
                            "handler": "stopInterval",
                            "params": {
                                "id": "ecommerce_export_track_poll"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "handler": "setState",
                            "params": {
                                "target": "global",
                                "ecommerceExportTracking": null
                            }
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ],
            "props": {
                "type": "button",
                "aria-label": "$t:sirsoft-ecommerce.admin.export.tracking.dismiss",
                "className": "text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 dark:hover:text-gray-300"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Icon",
                    "props": {
                        "name": "xmark",
                        "className": "text-xs"
                    }
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
